{"version":1,"content":"<p>Rockstar North聯合負責人兼開發主管Rob Nelson確認，《GTA6》的主要開發工作實際上已經完成，目前團隊已進入最終收尾階段。隨着發售臨近，開發者每天獲準調整的內容越來越少，但後續修正工作並未完全結束。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584306.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:07.731267+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:50:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.325681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:58:16.325681+00:00","content_hash":"09e56dced8115962f8bf31bc4cef78d3c1c8e880698a20133debfc3439ec66cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}